sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Phone browser
    participant F as Flask backend
    participant M as Keras model
    participant D as SQLite
    P->>P: Tap Start, motion permission (iOS)
    P->>F: POST /api/sessions
    F->>D: Insert session
    loop Every 1.5 s (after the first 3 s)
        P->>P: Collect samples at 20 Hz (50 ms timer)
        P->>F: POST /api/predict (60 x 6, session id)
        F->>M: Preprocessed 1 x 60 x 8 window
        M->>F: 6 class probabilities
        F->>F: Rules and session smoothing
        F->>D: Insert prediction
        F->>P: JSON prediction
    end
    P->>F: POST /api/sessions/{id}/end
    P->>F: GET /api/sessions/{id} (History)
    F->>D: Read session and predictions
    F->>P: Timeline, CSV and PDF links
